{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39732","headline":"浙幕李端公泛建溪 · 黄滔","name":"浙幕李端公泛建溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越城吴国结良姻，交发芙蓉幕内宾。\n自顾幽沈槐省迹，得陪清显谏垣臣。\n分题晓并兰舟远，对坐宵听月狖频。\n更爱延平津上过，一双神剑是龙鳞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}